// QNMF Pillar 6: Mixed Complexity Task Benchmark (100 Tasks)
// Tier 0: 30 Easy tasks (single-digit arithmetic)
// Tier 1: 30 Medium tasks (two-digit arithmetic, 2-step grid path)
// Tier 2: 20 Hard tasks (multi-digit arithmetic, 5-step grid planning)
// Tier 3: 20 Very Hard tasks (grid obstacles, 2-step deductive logic)

network TasksToySpec ⟦
    dense ⟬100⸴ 64⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬64⸴ 4⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "TASKS_TOY_100_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
